</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.41</h2><ul><li><strong>After a Codex account switch, reset cards show the new account&#x27;s count.</strong> With Reset cards on under Settings → Providers → Codex → Panel, switching the ChatGPT account Codex is signed in with shows how many that account has, a failed read says Couldn&#x27;t read, and a count of zero still says None. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/106">#106</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.41">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
